{"id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-degree-jump.md","title":"Jump on Degrees","display":"df-degree-jump — Jump on Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-degree-jump","aliases":["68-df-degree-jump"],"display":"df-degree-jump — Jump on Degrees","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-degree]]","[[68-df-turing-jump]]","[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 pp.58-59 / PDF 67-68","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"well-definedness-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-degree-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-degree-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-jump — Jump on Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e86854d09364356c\" href=\"?note=e86854d09364356c\" title=\"68-lem-jump-representative-invariance\">68-lem-jump-representative-invariance</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 pp.58-59 / PDF 67-68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"well-definedness-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a>，集合跳跃见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a>。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e86854d09364356c\" href=\"?note=e86854d09364356c\" title=\"68-lem-jump-representative-invariance\">68-lem-jump-representative-invariance</a> 给出同度代表的跳跃仍同度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a&#39;:=\\bigcup\\{\\deg(A&#39;):A\\in\\mathbf a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a&#39;:=\\bigcup\\{\\deg(A&#39;):A\\in\\mathbf a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a^{(0)}:=\\mathbf a,\\qquad\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}:=(\\mathbf a^{(n)})&#39;,\\qquad\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;:=(\\mathbf0&#39;)&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a^{(0)}:=\\mathbf a,\\qquad\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}:=(\\mathbf a^{(n)})&#39;,\\qquad\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;:=(\\mathbf0&#39;)&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由于代表元跳跃不变性，花括号中的集合族是单元素族，取并恰为唯一的跳跃度，不需要任意选择代表。有限迭代现已进入 Assertion；零跳与度定义中指定的 deg(∅′) 相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-lem-jump-representative-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"e86854d09364356c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]] 给出同度代表的跳跃仍同度。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]] 给出同度代表的跳跃仍同度。","embed":false},{"target":"68-lem-jump-representative-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"e86854d09364356c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。[[68-lem-jump-representative-invariance]] 给出同度代表的跳跃仍同度。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D,\\deg,\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a':=\\bigcup\\{\\deg(A'):A\\in\\mathbf a\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a^{(0)}:=\\mathbf a,\\qquad\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}:=(\\mathbf a^{(n)})',\\qquad\\mathbf0'':=(\\mathbf0')'.","display":true}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"050030684fcc654f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，度跳跃及 $\\mathbf0''$ 见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]；度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。本节点采用 $\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0'$ 范围内的低高分类。"},{"id":"4ce0116f26f0a357","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，度跳跃及 $\\mathbf0''$ 见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]；度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。本节点采用 $\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0'$ 范围内的低高分类。"},{"id":"38307057883ddb78","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。有限度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。以下同时定义谓词与其在 r.e. 度上的扩张集合；$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]。"},{"id":"91c9057d86d1e5c9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。有限度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。以下同时定义谓词与其在 r.e. 度上的扩张集合；$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]。"},{"id":"1391f74d0e8dd998","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-jump]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-jump]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-jump|df-degree-jump — Jump on Degrees]]"}],"outgoing":["43fcc2f44ce938e0","36459bc8c6a3f6a6","e86